# The app and the sync service share the same hostname
# (shizi.realxco.com — one nginx "holding service" for everything, see
# infra/README.md), with nginx reverse-proxying /assessment/sync/* to the
# sync-service container (see infra/nginx-assessment.conf). Nested under
# /assessment/ (this app's own path prefix, matching vite.config.ts's
# `base`) rather than a sibling top-level /sync, so this app's whole
# footprint stays self-contained under one prefix. Same-origin relative
# path, not a separate domain — no CORS to configure either.
VITE_SYNC_ENDPOINT=/assessment/sync
# Must match SYNC_SHARED_TOKEN set on the sync service itself.
VITE_SYNC_TOKEN=
